{
  "key": "letter-096-part-01",
  "number": 96,
  "generationId": "01a1e632-25fd-7af3-b286-405cd727c36c",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1970-96/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.684399
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "This is a good beginning to the struggle and I am glad to have pushed you into it.",
      "path": "audio/1970-96/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.910907,
      "end": 6.077551
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Sannyas is a challenge to the world, a fundamental declaration of freedom.",
      "path": "audio/1970-96/03.mp3",
      "start": 7.456735,
      "end": 11.683672999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "To live in freedom every moment is sannyas.",
      "path": "audio/1970-96/04.mp3",
      "start": 13.019184000000001,
      "end": 15.971813999999998
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Now, insecurity will always be with you, but that is a fact of life.",
      "path": "audio/1970-96/05.mp3",
      "start": 17.291905,
      "end": 21.610771
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "The only certainty is death; life is insecurity, and that is its joy and its beauty.",
      "path": "audio/1970-96/06.mp3",
      "start": 22.759728,
      "end": 28.924785
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "To be locked in security is suicide, a living death effected by one's own hand.",
      "path": "audio/1970-96/07.mp3",
      "start": 30.269637,
      "end": 35.691088
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Such living-dead are everywhere.",
      "path": "audio/1970-96/08.mp3",
      "start": 36.851678,
      "end": 39.045804999999994
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "They have turned the world into a graveyard, and they number amongst them many celebrated corpses.",
      "path": "audio/1970-96/09.mp3",
      "start": 40.692177,
      "end": 46.400839
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "They all have to be awakened, though for their part they are trying to put back to sleep even those who are awake.",
      "path": "audio/1970-96/10.mp3",
      "start": 48.004354,
      "end": 55.35
    }
  ]
}
